{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52058","headline":"新园旦坐 · 王绩","name":"新园旦坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林宅资余构，园亭今创营。\n［接梨过半箸］（据李抄本补），从此近全生。\n凿沼三泉漏，爲山九仞成。\n草香罗户穴，茅茹结檐楹。\n松栽一当伴，柳种五爲名。\n独对三春酌，无人来共倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}